---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
const UPDATED = '2026-10-06';
const title = 'Cookies: none on Calcul Divorce, the French divorce calculator';
const description = 'Calcul Divorce sets no cookies: child support and compensatory payment are worked out without keeping anything. Only site stability is measured, anonymously.';
---
<PageLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>Calcul Divorce <strong>sets no cookies</strong> on your device. Since there is nothing to accept, the site shows no choice pop-up. Full details of processing are in the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Your divorce figures stay with you</h2>
    <p>Both parents’ income, number of children, custody arrangement, length of the marriage, value of the property to be shared: child support, the compensatory payment and the soulte are calculated in your browser. Nothing is sent to a server, nothing is put in a cookie or in browser storage, and it all disappears when you leave the page. The publisher records no personal data.</p>

    <h2>What is measured: stability, cookie-free</h2>
    <p>Microsoft Clarity runs in <strong>cookie-free</strong> mode for one reason only: checking that the site works. It notes script errors, loading times, clicks that do nothing and scrolling. In this mode no <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code> cookie is set; every page view carries its own identifier, so one visit is never tied to another. Displayed text and the values you type are masked before anything is sent.</p>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Answer</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Tool provider</td><td>Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Purpose</td><td>spotting breakdowns and slow pages</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Retention</td><td>30 days (recordings), 13 months (aggregates)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Legal basis</td><td>legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR)</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cookies</td><td>none</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>No other measurement tool, no advertising and no social media tracker is loaded.</p>

    <h2>Opting out</h2>
    <p>Block the <code>clarity.ms</code> domain (content blocker or browser settings) and the calculators keep working exactly the same. You can also write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>; complaints may be lodged with the CNIL, the French data protection authority. Updated: {UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
